    summary: Taming, keeping and riding horses.
  creatures:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: afbf4a58442496641826a078787f7e2e, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e646ff37405b36e43a4fa710a23060e2, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b22c293353a041944aa0e1f4eb3bcb99, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87ebac26be444f642bbd6de5b4fa2766, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d702ae3d8ee6e442a576d496cbec3d4, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f728b8ea230e9154b865d39c8e5d49be, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 73e1e95ef9042da4bab4b30a2b0d157f, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 20c7f11cbb9bb214f95fc0f2a51db9d9, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: abf292b6af701c64eb533aad22ee47c6, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fc74e15f41da234fb9eeedcfe1067f0, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f66a8d86463697438ce75621f51e12d, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1b3879bd0caf9a43892f7b5aff2bfee, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 780dd3de177d4ca41b12a65f95fa709b, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 18c8362f09cf64a468e9ae4ae6d4422b, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6831da450ee487246b0f7f72b7e0272f, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c3027c5ca1de044a5a8f75d3b93dcb, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 489a951193635d0419115cdcc5775d51, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 916ab17a0415c3041aec1267259d1567, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0d3ffee305a6ca489fca58781bf31c1, type: 2}
  residentNotes:
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4260d606f7c62c042b848adc806c44d3, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afbf4a58442496641826a078787f7e2e, type: 2}
    text: The pack circles to the side you favour. Stand with a tree behind your weak hand and they run out of places to come from.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 33e7204287863854f8c6ad025490f531, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afbf4a58442496641826a078787f7e2e, type: 2}
    text: Kill the one that's biting. Everyone wants to go for the big one.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4260d606f7c62c042b848adc806c44d3, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e646ff37405b36e43a4fa710a23060e2, type: 2}
    text: It only knows straight lines. I've watched one miss me and carry on through a fence.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: de521ad7beeb20b49878a9b40c96bced, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 916ab17a0415c3041aec1267259d1567, type: 2}
    text: Don't run. It's worse if you run. I stood still for most of a day once, and it only sniffed me.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df34e8e1df8ff0241a216bfddf9b631c, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f66a8d86463697438ce75621f51e12d, type: 2}
    text: Good timber, once. That's what makes it sad. Go for where the limbs join, same as you would with any bad joint.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df34e8e1df8ff0241a216bfddf9b631c, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 20c7f11cbb9bb214f95fc0f2a51db9d9, type: 2}
    text: They come apart if you hit them along the grain. I don't know why you would be sorry about it, but you are, a bit.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8adfc30233928ec499c01587419eabaa, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1b3879bd0caf9a43892f7b5aff2bfee, type: 2}
    text: It isn't lost. It isn't leading you anywhere either. As far as I can tell it's just looking for someone, and you'll do.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 33e7204287863854f8c6ad025490f531, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 18c8362f09cf64a468e9ae4ae6d4422b, type: 2}
    text: I knew what they were before anyone told me. They hold the line better than anyone I ever served with. Don't stand in front of it.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 33e7204287863854f8c6ad025490f531, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6831da450ee487246b0f7f72b7e0272f, type: 2}
    text: Same as any shield wall, and it's a wall of one. Go round.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8adfc30233928ec499c01587419eabaa, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 18c8362f09cf64a468e9ae4ae6d4422b, type: 2}
    text: The mail is older than the barrow. I would like to know who they were buried by.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b230d041259b863428e4e973c6ff0d86, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 489a951193635d0419115cdcc5775d51, type: 2}
    text: If she knows your name, you have already stayed too long. Keep walking and don't look at her back.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 272895da9ba7e784b8a97bcd2be637c8, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 780dd3de177d4ca41b12a65f95fa709b, type: 2}
    text: The venom keeps very well, if you can bear to carry it. So do I, as it turns out.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 272895da9ba7e784b8a97bcd2be637c8, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c3027c5ca1de044a5a8f75d3b93dcb, type: 2}
    text: Whatever it's saying to the ground, the ground is listening. Reach it first or you will be fighting all afternoon.
  - who: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b230d041259b863428e4e973c6ff0d86, type: 2}
    about: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0d3ffee305a6ca489fca58781bf31c1, type: 2}
    text: I've met people like it. It would be easier if it were cruel.
  findChance: 0.2
